## Lore

The Rift Control Study Group is a specialised branch of combat scientists
charged with studying and containing the Rifts. It is headquartered at the
Devil''s Gate in East St. Louis, where a huge containment complex is nearly
finished, and runs a company in the ruins of Old Chicago. Its mission is to
learn how Rifts and dimensional phenomena work and whether they can be
controlled, and to contain - capture, study or exterminate - whatever comes
through.

RCSG scientists work in places like the Magic Zone, the Chi-Town ruins, Old
Detroit and Calgary, and are attached to special mission teams wherever magic,
the supernatural or Rifts are a factor. They are men of science, but trained
soldiers too.

## GM Notes

RPA pilots, robot troops, Psi-Hounds and the occasional Commando or Special
Forces team serve as the RCSG''s combat support and containment force.

Available on assignment: explosives, heavy weapons, sensory, recording, medical,
communications and surveillance gear, mine detection and EOD equipment,
experimental weapons, a radiation suit (Dead Boy armor is not environmental),
a vehicle and rations, plus access to most military medical, laboratory and
computer facilities. Security clearance is mid to high depending on level and
record.
